<text top="393" left="193" width="327" height="22" font="11">- avoid using plastic forks/knives/plates, etc.</text>
<text top="393" left="193" width="398" height="22" font="11">- collect used paper/newspapers/magazines/recycling</text>
<text top="393" left="193" width="474" height="22" font="11">- put recycling bins/out/classrooms/teachers’ room/playground.</text>
<text top="393" left="193" width="206" height="22" font="11">- plant a tree/take care of it.</text>
